10 REM --- NETFLIX SPECTRUM WITH FADE ---
20 BORDER 0: PAPER 0: CLS
30 BRIGHT 1

40 REM --- DRAW COLORFUL VERTICAL BARCODE LINES ---
50 FOR x = 0 TO 255 STEP 4
60 REM Cycle colors 1 to 6 (Blue, Red, Magenta, Green, Cyan, Yellow)
70 LET col = 1 + INT(RND * 6)
80 INK col
90 PLOT x, 20: DRAW 0, 135
100 NEXT x

110 REM --- DRAW THE RED LOGO "N" OVER THE LINES ---
120 INK 2: REM Hard Red
130 REM Left Column
140 FOR y = 30 TO 140: PLOT 100,y: DRAW 12,0: NEXT y
150 REM Right Column
160 FOR y = 30 TO 140: PLOT 144,y: DRAW 12,0: NEXT y
170 REM Diagonal Ribbon Bridge
180 FOR x = 0 TO 32
190 LET y = 140 - (x * 3.4)
200 PLOT 100+x, y: DRAW 12,0
210 NEXT x

220 REM --- DRAMATIC PAUSE BEFORE FADE ---
230 PAUSE 75

240 REM --- SIMULATED SPECTRUM FADE OUT ---
250 INK 0: REM Use Black to wipe background lines
260 FOR x = 0 TO 95 STEP 2
270 REM Wipe left side going inward
280 PLOT x, 20: DRAW 0, 135
290 PLOT x+1, 20: DRAW 0, 135
300 REM Wipe right side going inward
310 PLOT 255-x, 20: DRAW 0, 135
320 PLOT 254-x, 20: DRAW 0, 135
330 REM Small delay to control speed of the fade
340 POKE 23672,0: IF PEEK 23672 < 1 THEN GO TO 340
350 NEXT x

360 REM --- CLEAN UP REST OF BACKGROUND CHIPS ---
370 FOR x = 96 TO 99: PLOT x,20: DRAW 0,135: NEXT x
380 FOR x = 113 TO 143: PLOT x,20: DRAW 0,135: NEXT x
390 FOR x = 157 TO 165: PLOT x,20: DRAW 0,135: NEXT x

400 REM --- DISPLAY FINAL WORDMARK ---
410 INK 2: PRINT AT 20,11;"NETFLIX"

